            "review_title": "Review at OZA Milk Tea - Coffee - Food",
            "review_text": "Jane V\nFort Wayne, Indiana58 contributions\n0\nSpecialty dinner party celebration\nAug 2018 • Friends\nWelcoming staff. Variety of seating accommodations. Living Plants and Vines. Eclectic \ndecor. Cool, inviting interior with the sound of the waterfall. Easy to navigate menu and display menu. Great beefsteak. The beef is flown in from Australia. Come enjoy a meal or getaway to work in a life infused setting.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 20, 2018",
